{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act27side_level_act27side_07_end",
  "groupId": "act27side",
  "stageId": "act27side_07",
  "title": "靠著我的肩膀哭泣",
  "storyCode": "SL-7",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act27side/level_act27side_07_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "07dfffd152b8d2b0f1027f69bc4fe19d8f1a9f98f0938d2dd596e21e19e9374b",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "41_g5_siestaunbuiltland_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我記得這裡應該是工業用地，不應該隨意靠近的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是離舊汐斯塔最近的地方，就讓我在這裡靜靜吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是嗎？可是這裡離舊汐斯塔那麼遠，還看得清什麼嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "羅德島辦事處應該離市政廳辦公大樓不遠。你回到汐斯塔有兩個月，也沒有來看過我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "市長先生這段時間難道不該忙得焦頭爛額，壓根沒空看家人一眼嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒事的時候在街上隨便走走，聽聽有多少人在罵你，也就大概清楚你最近過得怎麼樣了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......有許多事，我的確做得還不夠好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "作為一個汐斯塔人，我也想質問市長："
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼汐斯塔曾經引以為傲的火山、海岸、文化、音樂全都不見了？為什麼有那麼多人無法融入新的生活市政廳卻無能為力？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還想指責市政廳為什麼沒有早做搬遷的準備。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是作為赫爾曼·道爾科斯的女兒，我還是要說——爸爸，辛苦了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我這次回來，本來是打算幫羅德島在這裡建立辦事處，可是我打聽到，現在的汐斯塔感染者好像遇到了一些額外的困難。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哥倫比亞在法條上咬文嚼字做文章，這不過是哥倫比亞的一張牌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們不會在意幾個感染者的死活，他們只想要從汐斯塔將來的大宗跨國貿易中分一杯羹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "八千五百七十三。我查過資料。這是截至上個月，在汐斯塔定居的登記在冊的感染者的數量。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要嘛從此禁止感染者在汐斯塔移動地塊上定居，要麼替他們繳納巨額的醫療保險。在旁人來看，對於市政廳來說後者完全不能算作選項。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不可能不記得，我的另一個女兒，也是感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在汐斯塔短暫的幾十年歷史中，面對過的刁難也不在少數，但汐斯塔走的路，始終掌握在汐斯塔人自己手裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會想辦法......總會找到路的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就讓我來幫一點忙吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "面對哥倫比亞的文字遊戲，你同樣可以在移動城市外劃定一片地區，宣稱汐斯塔會在此進行拓荒，拓荒工作交由感染者來完成。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而至於他們具體的工作——最近來到汐斯塔的那兩位朋友，也有意幫助我。一個剛剛起步的物流公司，應該可以提供許多就業崗位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "另外，我會借助羅德島的資源，在汐斯塔建立感染者治療中心，這是我一直想要做的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為了黑，也為了更多無辜的人。我可不只是需要你照顧的人，我也會用我的方式來保護汐斯塔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我記得我女兒的大學主修，好像不是政治？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一些不情願的耳濡目染罷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然政治不是這麼簡單的事，但你能有這樣的心思，我很欣慰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你剛才說的感染者治療中心的這一部分，我會認真考慮的。與峯馳物流的合作，我也會繼續履行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從你成為市長以來，汐斯塔對感染者的態度一直都相對寬鬆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有人說你是故作姿態，爭取礦工們的支持；也有人說你只是為了旅遊業能賺來更多錢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我現在更願意相信，你做的這些事，和媽媽有關。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......是什麼時候知道的......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就在剛剛，我聽說了一點故事，關於媽媽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你從來沒有主動和我說起這些故事，甚至很少主動和我提起媽媽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "芭芭拉，是維多利亞人。在那個時候的汐斯塔人看來，想要吞併汐斯塔的維多利亞就是最大的敵人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我忙碌於那些有關哥倫比亞和維多利亞的繁重外交工作，卻從來不敢讓人知道自己的妻子恰好來自維多利亞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "芭芭拉卻從來沒有將這件事放在心上，她有自己的事業。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她說，她在以她的方式保護這座城市，也在保護你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“用自己的方式保護這座城市......”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你從來沒有和她共同生活過一天，但是你剛剛和她說了一模一樣的話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......她是個很好的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她也有個很好的女兒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......謝謝你，錫蘭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個，機位稍微再下調一點，稍微仰拍一點，這樣顯得我比較有氣勢......等等，太低了。好，就這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "檢查一下錄音，接下來我說的每一句話，都要錄得清清楚楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "尊敬的亞當斯·詩懷雅先生，您好。和往常一樣，先祝您身體健康。\n這份光碟寄到您手中的時候，我應該已經結束了汐斯塔的旅行，也完成了我需要達成的一切商業目的。\n或許您依舊認為這是一個孩子的胡鬧——不，憑您的眼光應當已經認識到了這座城市的價值——一個獨立自由的貿易港口能擁有的價值。\n我知道從我到汐斯塔的第一天起就有家族的人跟在我周圍，監視我的一舉一動，或許是您的意思，或許是您的其他繼承人對我的阻撓。\n但是不重要了，我早就明白揣度您的心思是一件費力且毫無意義的事。\n只是，如果站在我的對立面的人是您的話，那麼這一次，是我贏了您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_offce"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歐厄爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_539_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼專門把我叫到這來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_990_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想和您匯報，關於這次的專案，峯聯貿易已經和汐斯塔簽訂了協議。順利的話，大概在秋天就可以開始動工了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_990_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在物流中心建設好之後，貿易活動將先在薩爾貢、維多利亞、哥倫比亞三個國家之間展開，隨著產業鏈的成熟，這個範圍還會繼續擴大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_990_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "新汐斯塔獨立城邦帶來的天然貿易優勢，還有這裡的人們對於外來商品的歡迎，可以讓我們對將來峯聯貿易的發展有信心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_990_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您一直告訴我峯馳物流想要實現的未來圖景，現在才算真正踏出了第一步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歐厄爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_539_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這次專案的報告我都已經看過了，做得很不錯，沒有讓我失望。不，應該說你的成長的確令我驕傲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歐厄爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_539_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剩下的夏天，給自己好好放個假吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_990_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝您的認可，但是還有一份報告，您應該沒有看過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_990_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "關於“峯聯貿易”從“峯馳物流”獨立切分的工作程序。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歐厄爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_539_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_990_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從現在開始，“峯聯貿易”不再是峯馳物流的子公司，以新汐斯塔為核心開展的一系列商業活動與峯馳物流無關。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歐厄爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_539_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你知道這個決定意味著什麼嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_990_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "作為峯馳物流的董事長兼總裁，您對峯聯貿易的業務不再有權干涉，峯聯貿易的一切負債與責任，都不用您的峯馳物流來承擔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_990_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然，在您不知曉的情況下做出了這樣的決定，程式上當然有曖昧模糊的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_990_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果您不同意我的選擇，直接按法律程式起訴的話，我恐怕會面臨不小的麻煩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歐厄爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_539_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我更想知道，你為什麼要這麼做？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_990_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這一直是您想要跨出的一步，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_990_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用在意商業聯合會的掣肘，由峯馳物流來真正改變這片大地的格局。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歐厄爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_539_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的確讓我很意外......看來你已經積蓄了足夠的力量。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_990_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然，我找到了一位可靠的合作夥伴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在汐斯塔度假的這幾天，讓我見識到了這是一個怎樣年輕且富有生命力的城市。因為年輕，所以面臨著種種問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但正是因為年輕，所以才有無限的可能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其實我從很早之前便開始思考一個問題，像您這樣一個日薄西山的老頭，到底為什麼能牢牢掌控住家族中那麼多各自心懷鬼胎的人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我思考了很久才得到這個問題的答案，那就是，您讓自己活成了一個象徵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "每個人都不知曉您的真實意圖，也不知道身邊的哪一位就是您的心腹。在這種未知的恐懼裡，每個人唯一的選擇就是對您俯首貼耳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您用這種方式牢牢掌控了商業聯合會乃至龍門的經濟命脈幾十年。這恐怕是我永遠也學不會的手段。但是......這樣的掌控總是有盡頭的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在您百年之後，商業聯合會該如何面對群龍無首的局面，又有多少人會趁亂不顧一切地為自己牟利，我想那也不是您願意看到的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或許您對自己的私人醫生還很有信心，但是作為龍門近衛局的準局長，也作為龍門的青年一代，我必須為沒有您的龍門早做打算。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "龍門的秩序，不該只掌握在一個人手中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_990_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果不是成為一名信使，我不會知道這片大地上各個地區、國家之間會有這麼大的差異。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_990_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是巨大的空間跨度讓交流變得無比艱難，才讓不同文明生長成了風貌各異的樣子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_990_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以當有人在這些國家和地區之間架起橋樑的時候，勢必會引發劇烈的變革。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_990_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "許多人本能地恐懼這種改變，會有人消極守舊，會有人想趁局勢動盪謀求私利。但改變這種格局的行為本身，一定是有積極意義的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_990_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是峯馳物流的理想，也是我作為一名信使的理想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我從來沒有後悔過成為一名近衛局警司。但這些年過去，我意識到自己能做的事不止有維護龍門的治安，我同樣有建設它的力量。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "與峯聯貿易的合作就是我的籌碼，我相信在龍門未來的經濟市場裡，跨國貿易一定會是不可或缺的部分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當所有人都跟在您身後，眼盯著您留下的遺產的時候，我會憑自己的手段在龍門商會佔據一席之地，主導新的秩序。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "晚霞再燦爛，新的太陽總會升起來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "41_g10_siestapremiumhotel"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雪雉，錄好了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1005_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1005_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "詩懷雅小姐，你剛剛說的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這份錄影之後就寄到龍門去。雖然很想親眼看看那個老頭子憤怒的表情，不過也大概能想像出是什麼樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是過一會我發現我的所有卡全都被凍結了也不奇怪就是了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1005_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真、真的嗎？那我們會被扣在這裡嗎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那到時候可以借一下你的錢嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1005_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1005_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是詩懷雅小姐真的需要幫助的話......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "開玩笑的，我帶的現金也夠我們好好享受完這個假期了，剩下的麻煩就等回到龍門再說吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了，現在事情才算真正做完了，準備正式開始這個假期吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "41_g5_siestaunbuiltland_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樂器店男老闆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1000_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "遮陽傘就不用撐了吧，布置好了也都要天黑了，還遮什麼太陽呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樂器店男老闆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1000_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們之前開店用的燒烤架一定要擺好，快一年沒擺攤了，但今天它一定受歡迎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樂器店女老闆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1001_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沙蟲腿嗎？現在都沒有貨源啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樂器店男老闆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1000_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之前的博覽會我看到有賣的，幫你囤了一點，就放在吉他後面的那個冰箱裡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樂器店女老闆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1001_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的？——太好了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1005_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼——湯姆爺爺，您的冰品給您搬過來啦！還有什麼需要幫忙的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冰品店店主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1002_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太謝謝你了小妹妹，忙前忙後幫了我這麼多。來，這個冰淇淋給你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1005_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝您~"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路人A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們又要開始賣烤肉了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路人B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是要辦晚會啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路人A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼晚會，我怎麼沒聽說？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樂器店女老闆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1001_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "商業街的大家在搬家之前聚一聚！下次再見，下次再開店，也都不知道是什麼時候啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大家要小心用火哦，注意安全！晚上了也小心別太靠近海邊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1005_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有什麼需要幫忙的，我都會盡力的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不是和詩懷雅一起來度假的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1005_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，這幾天住下來，還是覺得這樣有意思啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......您好，請問一下，這個口琴多少錢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樂器店男老闆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1000_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你要是喜歡的話，直接拿走也行。只是要教材的話，我就要收你一點錢了。哈哈，我都是這樣保證買了樂器的人一定會去學它的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先生，您會吹口琴嗎？口琴吹起來會是什麼感覺呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樂器店男老闆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1000_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然會了！口琴吹起來的感覺的話......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樂器店男老闆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1000_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "像風一樣，風吹樹葉，沙沙作響，像踩在沙灘上一樣，海水拍打沙礫，就是口琴的感覺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樂器店男老闆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1000_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等會燒烤的煙升起來，我的吉他彈起來，你就知道這感覺是什麼了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樂器店女老闆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1001_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "來吧，想吃什麼都可以，自己拿食材過來，我也可以幫你們烤哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路人A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等下等下，我還有上次搬家剩下的彩帶什麼的，等我給你們拿來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路人B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，我也來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "41_g9_purewhitevolcano_inside"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈莉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_994_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "埃尼斯，幫我把這些東西搬去晚會那邊吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4106_bryota_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇，這些酒不都是你珍藏的？這麼大方？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈莉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_994_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就當送別這片商業街，也送別老汐斯塔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4106_bryota_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小的時候大人們說火山總有一天會爆發，現在我們竟然真的離開那片海灘了，還在移動城市上有了新家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈莉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_994_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是房子就有被拆掉的一天，就算是這氣派又堅固的移動城市，也沒法和那座火山比誰能“活”得更長。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈莉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_994_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在就連火山都要醒了，汐斯塔也不能再睡懶覺了，還是跟著移動城市挪挪身子吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4106_bryota_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你這不是想得蠻開的嗎，那你還一直不樂意這家店......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈莉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_994_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能不能想通又怎樣呢？就算知道分別是無可避免的，也得為說再見好好準備呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4106_bryota_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我常常想不明白......我不知道自己待在哪裡才算有意義。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4106_bryota_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果我走了，算不算......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈莉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_994_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在你這個年紀的時候，可不會想那麼多麻煩的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈莉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_994_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我滿腦子都是跑去各種各樣的地方，認識各種各樣的人，玩各種各樣的搖滾，再學學那些人當地的語言，看怎麼把它編成一首歌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈莉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_994_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你也知道，我和查克就是在那樣的日子裡，在汐斯塔相識的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈莉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_994_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們想看看那些人說的美麗的“純白火山”，但在海灘和火山上晃蕩了好幾個月，最後也沒有見到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈莉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_994_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "正當我們準備離開汐斯塔，繼續尋找那個傳說的時候，我們卻在老汐斯塔那條風情街的角落裡，發現了一個安睡的嬰兒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈莉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_994_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以我們暫時留在汐斯塔，開了一家酒吧，查克繼續他的環遊，我決定留下來看看你這個小子能長成什麼樣，直到現在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4106_bryota_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈莉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_994_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果沒有發現你，“純白火山”可能就一直只是一個存在在傳說中的名字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈莉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_994_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "後來，我們又收養了路特，收養了麗芙......你們都漸漸長大，你也漸漸不再那麼愛笑了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈莉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_994_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但商品博覽會那天，店裡的衝浪板都不見了，你們也都被溫泉水澆得有點狼狽，可是你看上去真的很開心。說實話，我也很開心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈莉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_994_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那時我就在想，如果一些適當的改變，能讓一家人依然像過去一樣開開心心的，那也是一件好事啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈莉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_994_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "畢竟比起純白火山，我還是更在意你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4106_bryota_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4106_bryota_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有，我想等純白火山改建完畢之後，就......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈莉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_994_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘮嘮叨叨的，老朋友們都看不下去了。快去吧，埃尼斯，把酒給他們帶過去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈莉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_994_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒事的，孩子，不用擔心我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈莉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_994_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無論你想留在這裡，還是去汐斯塔外面看看——有了什麼打算，就去做吧，像老媽年輕時一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈莉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_994_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是等到琴弦都鬆了，可再也彈不好你想唱的曲子了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_992_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_992_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "埃尼斯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "41_g5_siestaunbuiltland_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "艾雅法拉，怎麼不和他們一起去玩？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不太會跳舞啦......跟上音樂的節奏對我來說還是有點困難......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......那我來陪你坐一會兒吧，我們也可以聊聊天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "上次你來我這裡看病，說自己有了幻覺，能看到小羊，我也以為是某種礦石病導致的幻視，可是那時......我也看到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它小小的，很溫暖，伏在我的胸口，聽我的心跳......我很確定我看到了，我也感受到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很奇怪......不知道為什麼，我會突然想起媽媽......我甚至從來沒有見過她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "艾雅法拉，那天的小羊，到底是什麼......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我做過一個夢，夢裡我穿著媽媽的防護服，和兩隻小羊一起玩了一整晚，它們也對我說了很多話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個夢讓我覺得很熟悉，就像小時候和爸爸媽媽在一起的時候一樣......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "稍遠處，一些煙火突然炸開。天還沒有暗下來，煙霧拖出一條長長的尾巴。\n偷放了煙花的小孩們嬉笑著跑遠，身後跟著他們笑罵著的父母。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小的時候，很少有和爸爸媽媽這樣玩耍的機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們把所有時間都花在了火山上，我也愛上了火山。那天之後我就一直在想，他們到現在都還在攀爬著吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的母親或許也還在做她喜歡做的事吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是艾雅法拉，我這樣想會不會很奇怪......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我這幾天經常會想，我要是能再看到那隻小羊就好了。或者和你剛才說的那樣，我要是能夢到它就好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......有再見過那隻小羊嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有了，它是我能看到的最後一隻......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樂器店女老闆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1001_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂——小姑娘們！別在那裡坐著了，過來吃烤肉吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1005_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "店主姐姐做的燒烤可好吃啦！艾雅法拉小姐，上次你們來汐斯塔也吃過嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不太記得了......上次來的時候，錫蘭小姐還是氣呼呼的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，那都多久之前的事情了，就別提啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "艾雅法拉，你這次來，覺得汐斯塔怎麼樣呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "比上回......更放鬆了，也更浪漫了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿黛爾，只要你身體允許，以後請多來汐斯塔玩玩吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那時候你就能看到一個，在許多人共同的努力下，變得越來越好的汐斯塔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "兩個人站在荒地上，看向海的那邊，隱隱約約能看到一些火山的影子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說，它什麼時候會爆發呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等那個時候，要做的事情又有很多吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。等到那時，我們也會做得很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或許這樣，我們也就能再看到小羊了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，凱勒老師......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......好的，我這就回去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "觀測火山的數據有點問題......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "火山要提前爆發了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "火山數據多變，這次可能是一個普通的數據異常，但......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果真的有什麼問題，我們會透過廣播告訴大家的。錫蘭，到時候就拜託你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
